title: f16 KV on GPU, 512-token prompt batches: tile kernel with and without its temporary buffer  (R1 7B Q4_K_S)
args: -m /home/wrekt/.lmstudio/models/mradermacher/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B-Uncensored-i1-GGUF/DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B-Uncensored.i1-Q4_K_S.gguf -ngl 99 -t 6 -fa 1 -ctk f16 -ctv f16 -nkvo 0 -d 0,4096,8192 -p 512 -n 0 -r 5
